WEBVTT

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:15.540
<i>Kakugane, the paranormal alloy forged</i> <i>from the essence of alchemy...</i>

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:19.780
<i>Activated by the person's fighting instinct,</i>

00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:23.180
<i>the possessor converts</i> <i>their latent power into form</i>

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:26.220
<i>and creates a weapon like no other.</i>

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:30.160
<i>That is Buso Renkin.</i>

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:46.470
l'm sorry, Tokiko...

00:00:47.440 --> 00:01:02.080
Kazuki!

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:07.950
<i>No One Could Ever Take His Place</i>

00:01:20.340 --> 00:01:24.740
The two Victors are indeed gone and world's crisis has passed.

00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:27.170
But, but this is...

00:01:30.780 --> 00:01:32.010
That's how it is!

00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:35.580
lt's absurdity.
That's how the world is!

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:41.820
Until now...as from now.

00:01:42.290 --> 00:01:44.690
You say that and yet, you have quite the long face.

00:01:45.860 --> 00:01:47.730
l understand how you're not satisfied with the results.

00:01:48.230 --> 00:01:50.720
However...results are results.

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:54.100
No matter how much sorrow there may be,

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:58.670
people's lives will continue as if nothing had happened.

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:07.410
No matter how much sorrow there may be.

00:02:14.060 --> 00:02:16.620
Yet, l believe that's the way things should be.

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:17.730
But...

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:20.500
lt's the duty of those who are left

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:23.570
to think about what should be done next,

00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:26.130
rather than being troubled over disappointing results.

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:28.230
You don't need to tell me!

00:02:28.610 --> 00:02:30.580
The clean up has already begun.

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:33.800
I'll be having you two work a little more.

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:40.880
Hey! Let's go.

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:42.210
Y-Yes, sir!

00:03:18.390 --> 00:03:19.450
<i>Tokiko...</i>

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:38.470
Where shall we go to drink?

00:03:38.810 --> 00:03:40.940
Who wants to go for another drink?!

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:41.570
You're so dirty.

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:43.110
Hey, taxi!

00:03:43.480 --> 00:03:45.010
Hey, stop, you jerk!

00:04:03.770 --> 00:04:04.700
How boring...

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:08.470
There's nothing here.

00:04:09.570 --> 00:04:12.440
The likes of a world without
Kazuki Muto...

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:14.570
A world like this...!

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:21.250
Kazuki...Muto...

00:04:34.630 --> 00:04:35.930
Tokiko Tsumura
Hey, hey, Tsumurin...

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:38.090
lt's about time we go to school.

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:42.100
Everyone understands.
Nobody will blame you.

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:48.840
You must face reality.
Muto's gone, now...

00:04:48.910 --> 00:04:49.570
l know.

00:04:50.820 --> 00:04:53.150
That's why l'm thinking now.

00:04:57.590 --> 00:05:02.990
Thinking about what l can do for Kazuki one last time before leaving this city...

00:05:07.770 --> 00:05:09.760
Has she been like that the whole time, Ouka?

00:05:10.130 --> 00:05:13.000
Yes. Despite everything, she's starting to recover.

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:14.870
She didn't even speak at all until today.

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:18.240
l don't blame her.
After going through something like that.

00:05:20.850 --> 00:05:22.780
Her physical wounds will eventually heal.

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:24.950
However, her wounded heart...

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:26.810
Tsumurin...

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:30.080
That being said, we can't just give up.

00:05:30.150 --> 00:05:32.560
l bet Muto would say that if he were here.

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:34.780
Muto... isn't here anymore...

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:38.060
But there should be something we can do.

00:05:38.530 --> 00:05:39.160
Yes...

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:40.490
Yeah!

00:06:20.070 --> 00:06:22.300
l couldn't even say anything to her.

00:06:22.810 --> 00:06:23.970
lt can't be helped.

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:27.070
There are no words that will reach her.

00:06:30.850 --> 00:06:31.910
Even so...

00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:34.690
No matter what you say, it would just hurt her.

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:37.020
All we can do is watch over her.

00:06:37.490 --> 00:06:39.860
Weren't you the one who said that, Bravo?

00:06:41.190 --> 00:06:42.820
l'm sure she'll be okay.

00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:47.300
l'm sure she'll be able to find the answer on her own.

00:06:47.830 --> 00:06:50.770
She was one of your subordinates, after all.

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:53.000
So l'm sure she'll be okay.

00:07:39.550 --> 00:07:41.820
<i>This world that Kazuki saved...</i>

00:07:58.100 --> 00:08:01.000
<i>This city Kazuki protected with his life.</i>

00:08:03.740 --> 00:08:07.110
<i>But, even so, l...</i>

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:13.910
<i>Tokiko!</i>

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:29.690
<i>Kazuki...</i>

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:36.970
What am l supposed to do?

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:41.140
Kazuki!

00:09:03.530 --> 00:09:04.520
l'm worried...

00:09:05.300 --> 00:09:07.640
Mahiro hasn't laughed at all since then.

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:09.900
And Tokiko hasn't come to school.

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:11.440
l wonder how they're doing?

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:14.180
Damn it!

00:09:15.710 --> 00:09:17.270
What the heck was that?!

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:19.480
We're outsiders,

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:24.090
so we still wouldn't know anything if Bravo hadn't told us.

00:09:24.590 --> 00:09:26.650
Shouldn't we just settle for that?

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:27.760
Rokumasu...

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:32.260
He risked his life to protect this world, right? And yet...

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:34.920
As a whole, isn't that how it is?

00:09:35.330 --> 00:09:37.460
People in the world are going about their lives

00:09:37.530 --> 00:09:41.770
not knowing that something has happened.

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:44.280
From here on... and beyond...

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:46.870
Don't talk as if you know!

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:51.640
Kazuki...

00:09:52.280 --> 00:09:53.050
Damn it!

00:09:57.490 --> 00:10:00.190
You idiot!

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:00.880
Don't abuse your body too much.

00:11:01.250 --> 00:11:01.910
Next!

00:11:25.510 --> 00:11:26.270
Tokiko!

00:11:27.510 --> 00:11:28.570
What are you doing?!

00:11:30.010 --> 00:11:32.880
Don't tell me you've been doing simulation battles the whole time!

00:11:34.390 --> 00:11:35.380
That's it, isn't it?!

00:11:37.620 --> 00:11:38.420
Unbelievable!

00:11:38.690 --> 00:11:40.920
You've just gotten better, so don't be pushing yourself too hard.

00:11:41.160 --> 00:11:42.590
Take better care of yourself...

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:45.360
N-Next...

00:11:47.660 --> 00:11:49.260
Tokiko! Tokiko!

00:11:58.040 --> 00:12:00.440
To be honest, l can't stand seeing you like this.

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:06.110
Please cheer up.

00:12:09.020 --> 00:12:12.890
lf it means your smile will return...
I'll do anything.

00:12:16.560 --> 00:12:17.720
Tokiko Senpai...

00:12:20.660 --> 00:12:22.900
Thank you. But...

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:51.230
<i>Kazuki...</i>

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:20.720
What can l do for you?

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:41.500
<i>But eventually I'll settle things</i> <i>with you, no matter what.</i>

00:13:42.010 --> 00:13:44.740
<i>lf l don't, l won't be able</i> <i>to flap my wings!</i>

00:13:44.980 --> 00:13:45.810
<i>Chono!</i>

00:13:48.320 --> 00:13:51.450
<i>I'll also settle things with you,</i> <i>no matter what!</i>

00:13:58.300 --> 00:13:59.700
...to settle things.

00:14:01.870 --> 00:14:03.860
How are the missions in all areas going?

00:14:04.670 --> 00:14:08.040
50% are complete.
The rest are in progress.

00:14:09.010 --> 00:14:11.500
To bring in every known and confirmed Homunculi

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:12.770
under our complete control.

00:14:13.110 --> 00:14:16.550
And a phased shutdown of
Alchemist Army activity.

00:14:17.050 --> 00:14:18.380
Are you serious, Shousei?

00:14:18.720 --> 00:14:20.880
Yes... l am having meetings

00:14:20.950 --> 00:14:22.510
with the Armies from various nations about it every day.

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:25.650
lt's been thousands of years since the study of alchemy began,

00:14:25.720 --> 00:14:28.350
and the completion of the Philosopher's Stone is still distant.

00:14:28.730 --> 00:14:31.750
Not only that, we have continued to make mistakes,

00:14:31.830 --> 00:14:34.130
unable to make good use of the power we have.

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:36.900
l believe it's about time for us to stop for a moment

00:14:36.970 --> 00:14:39.730
and reexamine our progress...

00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:42.970
ls that something that can be done?

00:14:43.240 --> 00:14:45.610
lt's not a matter of can or cannot. lt must be done.

00:14:46.680 --> 00:14:49.270
This is a responsibility we must execute

00:14:49.350 --> 00:14:51.750
for the two warriors who vanished into the moon.

00:14:53.180 --> 00:14:54.240
Great Warrior Chief.

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:57.220
Warrior Tokiko. What is it?

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:01.620
Great Warrior Chief, l have a request.

00:15:40.430 --> 00:15:41.690
l heard, Tokiko.

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:54.080
l will join you on your final mission to subdue Papillon.

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:15.230
Hey-hey, you guys are late! l was getting tired of waiting.

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:17.800
We have a general grasp of the situation.

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:19.370
We won't let you get the jump on us.

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:21.130
That's right, Tsumurin!

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:23.700
We were worried too, you see!

00:16:23.770 --> 00:16:26.440
And yet, what's the idea of trying to leave without saying a word?

00:16:26.740 --> 00:16:28.370
That's too much.

00:16:28.610 --> 00:16:30.740
Man, where did you learn of this?

00:16:30.950 --> 00:16:35.180
l wish you wouldn't take my informational network so lightly.

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:36.850
Your orders, Tsumura.

00:16:37.920 --> 00:16:38.890
Tokiko...

00:16:39.790 --> 00:16:42.950
Right, let's go.
This is our final mission.

00:17:09.820 --> 00:17:10.650
Tokiko.

00:17:11.190 --> 00:17:12.090
Tokiko Senpai.

00:17:12.620 --> 00:17:14.560
We are now in enemy territory.

00:17:14.890 --> 00:17:16.290
We must not lower our guard.

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:17.900
l know.

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:19.760
Let's go.

00:17:32.310 --> 00:17:34.300
lf you're going to watch the moon, do it someplace else.

00:17:34.880 --> 00:17:37.110
lf you're going to eat something, eat it someplace else.

00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:40.880
You want some? lt's my mama's flavoring.

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:44.490
Or to be precise, it's the flavor of the failed clone remains of my mama.

00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:47.050
lt doesn't satisfy my appetite.

00:17:47.660 --> 00:17:48.960
How rude of you to say that.

00:17:49.260 --> 00:17:52.250
This has been my main meal for close to a hundred years.

00:17:52.860 --> 00:17:55.390
l'd heard that you didn't have any urges for cannibalism,

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:57.160
but it seems it's true.

00:17:57.870 --> 00:18:00.960
lt seems it's said among a portion of researchers

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:03.400
that the source of a homunculus' cannibalistic urges

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:06.600
could be an instinctive attachment,

00:18:06.680 --> 00:18:11.110
so to speak in an attempt to regain the human elements they sacrificed.

00:18:12.380 --> 00:18:18.250
You don't have any attachment to humans, the human world or to society.

00:18:18.590 --> 00:18:20.490
You are incomplete as a homunculus.

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:24.090
But you've accomplished what other homunculi have been unable to do;

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:25.820
to break away from being human.

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:30.060
You are something completely new that's neither human nor homunculus.

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:32.130
You might literally be a superhuman.

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:35.400
Speak your nonsense someplace else.

00:18:35.810 --> 00:18:39.370
You're right. lt's nonsense to you and me.

00:18:39.880 --> 00:18:42.440
Then let me tell you one thing for your benefit.

00:18:43.150 --> 00:18:46.980
The Alchemist Warriors are coming. ls that okay?

00:18:47.150 --> 00:18:48.480
That's none of your concern.

00:18:48.990 --> 00:18:52.420
l have prepared an appropriate welcome for unwanted visitors.

00:18:55.890 --> 00:18:57.330
Long time no see.

00:18:57.960 --> 00:19:00.490
You really did it last time, didn't you?

00:19:01.730 --> 00:19:03.720
lt's time for revenge, revenge.

00:19:04.270 --> 00:19:06.740
You won't get past here.

00:19:07.170 --> 00:19:10.000
Animal-type homunculi created by Papillon.

00:19:10.470 --> 00:19:13.640
Did he resurrect them using Dr. Alec's cloning technology or something?

00:19:14.140 --> 00:19:15.510
lt's certain.

00:19:15.850 --> 00:19:17.610
Papillon is past here!

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:21.480
Let's go.

00:19:23.320 --> 00:19:24.480
Buso Renkin of Archery.

00:19:24.860 --> 00:19:25.910
Angel Gozen!

00:19:29.390 --> 00:19:32.490
Buso Renkin of Katana Sword.
Sword Samurai X!

00:19:35.730 --> 00:19:38.500
Buso Renkin of Chakram.
Motor Gear!

00:19:41.140 --> 00:19:44.630
Who's my opponent?
Come on, come on.

00:19:44.710 --> 00:19:45.680
Out of my way!

00:19:52.280 --> 00:19:53.940
You won't get through...

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:56.220
You won't get through.

00:19:56.850 --> 00:19:57.650
Clones...

00:20:03.890 --> 00:20:05.490
Go, Tsumura.

00:20:05.560 --> 00:20:07.000
No way will you get through!

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:11.030
Go, Tsumura!

00:20:21.210 --> 00:20:22.440
What do you want?

00:20:23.210 --> 00:20:25.510
Are you on a mission to eliminate me?

00:20:25.920 --> 00:20:29.720
No. l've come to settle things, Papillon.

00:20:30.550 --> 00:20:31.780
ln Kazuki's place.

00:20:32.690 --> 00:20:34.180
No one can replace him!

00:20:34.660 --> 00:20:38.460
Do you have a replacement for Kazuki Muto?!

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:51.490
Will my feelings reach you? l want to live on with you forever.

00:20:52.260 --> 00:20:54.360
Thank you, Kazuki.

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:59.100
Next time on the final episode of Buso Renkin: "Period."
